  d.add_paragraph('At each hourly origin t, use articles whose rounded-up publication proxy falls in (t−1 hour, t]. Compute four unweighted means: sentiment, XRP specificity, XRP stance and uncertainty. Add an article-presence indicator and hours since the latest eligible article, capped at 48. Empty hourly means are zero; presence distinguishes an empty archive hour from observed neutral news. No equation, event-category weights or decay signal enters this model.');equation(d,'direct_k(t) = mean{x(i,k) : t−1 < a(i) ≤ t}');equation(d,'presence(t) = 1[n(t)>0]; age(t) = min(48, t−max a(i))')
